              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Not offered as a managed service</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> $500/month minimum co-managed ad spend, on top of the fee</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
