              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Demo only, no free trial, no self-serve signup</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Leads Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Verified, enriched, scored prospect list you own forever</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Buyer leads included in every plan, not sold separately</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Answers Your Phone (AI Voice)</td>
