              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> No AI answering, callers reach you or voicemail</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Conversations on WhatsApp / Text</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Text Receptionist $297 one-time, full AI conversations</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> CINC AI $200/month add-on on every plan</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $499 / $999 / $1,999 one-time, you own the code</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Branded IDX website built and managed by CINC</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website Ownership</td>
