              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> English-focused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">CRM Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Notion CRM built for agents, free with the Base Agent</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Full real estate CRM, behavioural automation and lead scoring</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Team Tools</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> No per-agent routing or team leaderboard</td>
